<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 17/18.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 17/18.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on</p>
<p>Thursday set the following currency fixings for July 18. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   18.07.97	  17.07.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.6830	    6.7058</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.2262	    2.2328</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.3950	    4.4046</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4468	    3.4586</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5115	    0.5100</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7544	    0.7546</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2784	    0.2791</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.9378	    6.9511</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6907	    0.6914</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1470	    1.1420</p>
<p>-- Burton Frierson, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
